 "notes": [
  "Lane large-buildings-20261120 (2026-11-20), backlog row 17 (generic, wrong period). The W canal front (w01-274, 2017-07-07; the 66 m crop also holds the neighbouring classical house on the left, which is not this pand): brown brick, about ten window axes, six storeys under a cornice, cream window frames, a stone ground storey with a carved entrance. Brick #493b31 sampled on the S front (w06-184L) between windows; stone and frame cream by eye.",
  "Group 1 the S front on the Huidenstraat (w06-184L): the same brick, large cream-framed windows over the stone ground storey.",
  "Not modelled: the full-height stair light on the canal front, the small balconies on the right-hand window groups, the carved entrance cartouche. The E rear (22 m, no panorama) stays in the window grid."
 ]
